## References — Suggested Citations to Find

Search these on **IEEE Xplore** (ieeexplore.ieee.org):

1. Papers on **"cybersecurity education"** or **"hands-on security training"**
2. Papers on **"OWASP Top 10"** vulnerabilities
3. Papers comparing **"CTF platforms"** for education
4. OWASP official documentation (cite as a web reference)
5. IBM Cost of Data Breach Report (cite as industry report)

> Aim for **6–10 references**. Mix IEEE papers + OWASP docs + 1 industry report.

