## Final Checklist Before Submission

- [ ] Remove all placeholder/template text from the `.tex` file
- [ ] Add your name, department, college name, city, email in `\author{}`
- [ ] Add Architecture Diagram as Fig. 1
- [ ] Add Vulnerable vs Secure code comparison as a figure or listing
- [ ] Add Results table (user study or comparative)
- [ ] Make sure Abstract has **no** special symbols or math
- [ ] Proofread — avoid "we will", use "we present", "the system provides"
- [ ] Keep within page limit (usually 4–6 pages for IEEE conference papers)
